# API contract

Source: `docs/api-contract.md`. Every BE stack gives the same HTTP behaviour; `@atakanimo/ata-admin-base` and mobile know only this.

Key points: envelope `{ isSuccess, data, uiMessage, errorData, traceId? }`; `POST get-all` with nested `{ filters, page, limit, sortBy, sortOrder }` (strict, unknown key → 400); JSON identity is `id` only (no `_id`); `decimal` is a string; references accept ids only; `hidden` fields never returned; normal API exposes only `api.normalOperations`, writes only with ownership. `skipLoading` / `skipSuccessToast` are axios config fields handled by the host interceptor.
